  <h2>Billing &amp; subscriptions</h2>
  <p>Plans are billed by our payment provider when you purchase on the <a href="/pricing">pricing page</a>. To manage or cancel a subscription, open <a href="/settings">Settings</a> and choose <strong>Manage billing</strong>; you'll keep access until the end of your billing period. One-time Human Assistant bundles are not subscriptions and don't renew.</p>

  <h2>Report a problem</h2>
  <p>Found a bug or an application that didn't go through as expected? Email <a href="mailto:support@applyscout.app">support@applyscout.app</a> with details and we'll investigate.</p>
